## Course-level checks

| Check | After unit | Check days | Respond days | What it checks |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Level 1 mid-year | 3 | 1 | 1 | Week 16, level days 79 and 80. Samples units 2 and 3 in their own level: a fresh unplanned ink task logged (VA:Cr2.1.Ia), a hazard card item on an unseen material (VA:Cr2.2.Ia), and a written item on an unseen open-licensed image and how seeing it shapes a view of the world (VA:Re7.2.Ia). Unit 3's planning portfolio and critique record (days 75 and 76) are carried unscored; no start-route task repeats. Respond on day 80. |
